HPLIP 3.25.2
https://sourceforge.net/projects/hplip/files/hplip/3.25.2/hplip-3.25.2.tar.gz

Files are copied from prnt/hpcups/ in the tarball, except the HPLIP
shared libraries libImageProcessor-x86_32.so and libImageProcessor-x86_64.so
(prebuilt binaries, not included). common/utils.c and common/utils.h live
in ../common/ as hplip_utils.c and hplip_utils.h.

Local changes to upstream sources:
- #include "utils.h" became #include "hplip_utils.h" in the .cpp files that
  use it (macOS file systems are case-insensitive and "utils.h" matched
  Utils.h in this directory).
- genPCLm.cpp includes "hplip_utils.h" instead of "./../../common/utils.h".
- jccolor.c is kept for reference but is not built (it needs libjpeg 6b
  private headers). src/compat/hp_csc.c redoes its Mojave and standard
  RGB to YCbCr tables, and ModeJpeg.cpp converts JetReady rows with it and
  passes YCbCr to libjpeg. tests/csc-check.c compares the two.
